Z||000001||WKDFIRO||02-25-2000||03:24 PM||||Sounds like you need a new flasher. Look under your dash board and there should be a small round silver knob looking thing with only 2 wires going to it. I want to say that they are blue and yellow but Im not sure. It will have only 2 prong on it in an L configuration. They only cost like $2 from Pep boys if that much.||||reg||14
