Z||000004||theogre||02-25-2000||06:45 PM||||if it works ok for one side, and not the other, then it's a bulb, socket, or ground.<P>All your bulbs are good, or so you think. There are 5 lamps in each turn set for the notch back. I think the GT/FB is the same.<P>front park/turn<BR>2 rear park/break/turn<BR>front side marker<BR>dash indicator.<P>if any one of those hase a problem the whole side will wig out.||||reg||1
